        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Five fragments of dark blue satin weave silk, embroider in dark and light blue, white, red and yellow silks in loops; the design consists of two dragons pursuing a pearl, a butterfly, and smaller insects, and is repeated four times,twice along each of the longer sides of the panel."@en ;
